 * Types for Claude Code transcript parsing.
 *
 * Claude Code writes conversation transcripts as JSONL files (one JSON object
 * per line) under `~/.claude/projects/<project>/<sessionId>.jsonl`. Each line
 * is a `TranscriptEntry`. The entries relevant to tracing are:
